      "content": "SportsGameOdds API provides real-time sports betting odds data from 80+ sportsbooks across 50+ leagues including NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, NCAAF, NCAAB, EPL, UCL, UFC, PGA, and ATP. The API delivers live and pre-match odds across 3,000+ markets including moneylines, spreads, over/unders, team props, and player props, with official SDKs for JavaScript/TypeScript and Python.",
